["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">転がる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ころがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">滚动；翻滚；翻倒；滚倒；躺下；卧倒；散落；到处都是；（局面或结果）改变；转变；容易得到；随处可得；唾手可得</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148911\"><ruby>車輪<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃりん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はゆっくり<ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がり<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">轮子开始慢慢转动</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">殺す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ころす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">杀死；杀害；谋杀；屠杀；压制；阻断；妨碍；埋没（才能）；消除（气味）；损害（风味）；降低（速度）；压抑（声音、情感等）；忍住；憋住（哈欠、笑声等）；屏住（呼吸）；使（跑垒者）出局；典当；抵押</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227533\">おまえはオレを<ruby>殺<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>そうとしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你是想杀我</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">転ぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ころぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">跌倒；摔倒；（事情）发展成；结果是（常作「どう転んでも」）；弃教；改宗（从基督教改为佛教）；翻滚；打滚；（艺妓）私下卖淫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124958\"><ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby>手首<rp>(</rp><rt>てくび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>痛<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我摔倒了,手腕受伤了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怖い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こわい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">可怕；令人恐惧；诡异；令人害怕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"153050\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>怖<rp>(</rp><rt>こわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かったよりもびっくりした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我没有那么害怕 如此惊讶。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">壊す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こわす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">破坏；摧毁；拆毁；毁坏；破坏；损坏；毁损；破开（纸币等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210011\">その<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のすべての<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>壊<rp>(</rp><rt>こわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那打破了他所有的梦想。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/9954883\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">壊れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こわれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">破损；破裂；崩塌；毁坏；受损；发生故障；停止运转；落空；破裂；失败；中止；破坏（气氛、形象等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223988\">このイヤホンは<ruby>壊<rp>(</rp><rt>こわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些耳机不管用</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深蓝色；藏蓝色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190825\"><ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>紺<rp>(</rp><rt>こん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のスーツの<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>白衣<rp>(</rp><rt>はくい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">医生穿着白大衣穿蓝西装</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">魂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">阳气；魂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今回</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">这次；此次；现在</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172500\"><ruby>今回<rp>(</rp><rt>こんかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はしくじれないぞ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这次不能失败</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">根気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">耐心；毅力；坚持；韧性；干劲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194098\">もう<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>根気<rp>(</rp><rt>こんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があったら<ruby>成功<rp>(</rp><rt>せいこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していただろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">耐心一点,你会成功的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">根拠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんきょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">根据</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">その<ruby>主張<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>根拠<rp>(</rp><rt>こんきょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那个主张没有根据。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">拠</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コンクリート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">混凝土；砼</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124498\"><ruby>土台<rp>(</rp><rt>どだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はコンクリートで<ruby>固<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>められている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">地基是混凝土的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コンクール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">竞赛；比赛；竞争</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160380\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのコンクールに<ruby>参加<rp>(</rp><rt>さんか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我参加了比赛</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">混血</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんけつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">混血；混血血统</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74392\">「そっかぁ、アルクさんはワーウルフなんですね」「<ruby>俺<rp>(</rp><rt>おれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>混血<rp>(</rp><rt>こんけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だから<ruby>変身<rp>(</rp><rt>へんしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したりはしねーよ」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">&quot;哦,对了,你是狼人,不是吗?&quot; &quot;我是混血儿,所以我不变身什么的。&quot;</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今月</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんげつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">这个月；本月</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172460\"><ruby>今月<rp>(</rp><rt>こんげつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げはよくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个月的销售已经停了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今後</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">今后；从今以后；此后</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172427\"><ruby>今後<rp>(</rp><rt>こんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもっと<ruby>注意<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">以后要小心你的钱</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">混合</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんごう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">混合；融合；（种族）通婚；异族通婚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169506\"><ruby>三原色<rp>(</rp><rt>さんげんしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>混合<rp>(</rp><rt>こんごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すると<ruby>黒色<rp>(</rp><rt>くろいろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ができる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把三元色混合的话就会变成黑色 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5849909\" title=\"Tatoeba · pftest2382785\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · pftest2382785\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コンサート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">音乐会；演奏会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217514\">コンサートはどうだった？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">演唱会怎么样?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">混雑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんざつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拥挤；拥堵；拥塞；堵塞；混乱；纷乱；无序</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207425\">その<ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>混雑<rp>(</rp><rt>こんざつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">道路被车堵住了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今週</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">这周；本周</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172375\"><ruby>今週<rp>(</rp><rt>こんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどちらにいらしゃいましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这周你去哪儿了?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コンセント</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（电气）插座；墙壁插座；电源插座</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110349\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はラジオをコンセントにつないだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把无线电插进去了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コンタクト</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接触；联系；隐形眼镜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91411\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はメガネをはずしてコンタクトをはめた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她脱下眼镜 把她的联系人放进去</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">献立</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんだて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">菜单；菜谱；节目单；日程；安排</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204787\">それほど<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>人々<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のための<ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>献立<rp>(</rp><rt>こんだて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるのはむずかしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">许多人很难规划饭菜。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昆虫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">昆虫；虫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"163369\"><ruby>趣味<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>昆虫<rp>(</rp><rt>こんちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めることです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的爱好是收集昆虫</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">根底</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">根底；根基；基础</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222394\">この<ruby>議論<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>根底<rp>(</rp><rt>こんてい</rt><rp>)</rp>